  "title": "Catching Feebas in Pokemon Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire",
  "subtitle": "Fear not, its easy now.",
  "excerpt": "Long gone are the days of hours long hunts. ",
  "publishedDate": "2026-07-30",
