  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "block-698ff57c-d583-49ac-a4f9-045a1e70cbb0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Long gone are the days of hours long hunts. "
    },
    {
      "id": "block-ce5d76ff-4088-44ab-ab47-3a658a17e103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Many of us hardened anglers remember the days of spending hours, days, perhaps even weeks fishing up the elusive [Feebas](/pokemon/feebas)."
    },
    {
      "id": "block-2659abc8-8711-4c48-a395-e3530bc3ecbb",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Feebas now has a 5% chance of appearing with ANY rod on [Route 119](/location/hoenn-route-119)"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-6e083708-3482-43c7-80fe-8cf8d9ee78f1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In addition, If you fish under the bridge during the day, at the North of Route 119, you will have an almost impossible to imagine 100% chance to catch a Feebas.  This 100% chance also applies to the large rock in the south of the route at night. "
    },
    {
      "id": "block-a2d121a4-4787-4043-9de1-7aa580b54a5f",
      "type": "image",
      "src": "/images/topics/catching-feebas-in-pokemon-omega-ruby-and-alpha-sapphire/feebas119.webp",
      "alt": "Under the Bridge on Route 119",
      "caption": "During the day under the Bridge on Route 119, you have a 100% chance to catch Feebas.",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "thumbnail": "/images/topics/catching-feebas-in-pokemon-omega-ruby-and-alpha-sapphire/feebas119-400.webp",
      "optimized": true,
      "note": "Converted to WebP at quality 82 and capped at 1600px wide.",
      "displaySize": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-dde11481-a117-4f80-a178-6cafe70f36e9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This makes shiny, EV, or nature hunting much much easier. Especially with the new mechanics like Chain Fishing.\n\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "block-c7193fae-b80a-4856-b49e-908c9310285b",
      "type": "callout",
      "variant": "note",
      "title": "Beauty and the 'Bas",
      "text": "Once you catch [Feebas](/pokemon/feebas) (and you will!) Take a look at our guide. [Evolving Feebas into Milotic Via Beauty](/topic/evolving-feebas-into-milotic-via-beauty)"
    },
